      "Trade narration must obey systems.trade.gating_rules (no assumed neighbors or built ships).",
      "Campaign starts as a settlement (not a colony) with starting population=500 (campaign_default). Treat as established community; avoid 'colonial' framing unless explicitly introduced in state.",
      "Canon Impact (CI) middle fields must be descriptive phrases, not schema keys."
